    "title": "American Kennel Club's top dog breed in Detroit is out and it's French",
    "text": "WAYNEAmerican Kennel Club top dog breed in Detroit is out and it's French Jamie L. LaReauDetroit Free PressUpdated March 18, 2026, 3:42 p.m. ETSubscribe to hear this storyThe most popular dog breed in metro Detroit is also the most popular breed in the nation — and the while the golden retriever is in the top five, it is not No. 1.The American Kennel Club’s 2025 ranking of the most popular AKC-recognized dog breeds in the United States came out on March 18 and listed the top five most popular dog breeds in Detroit, according to its registrations, and the top two are small, but mighty breeds.",
